  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.7.0: Added type-constrained middleware support for Request and Notification pipelines. Enhanced middleware pipeline with generic type constraint validation for selective middleware execution based on interface types (ICommand, IQuery, INotification). New TypedMiddlewareExample sample project demonstrating type-constrained middleware with ICommand/IQuery distinction. Comprehensive test coverage for type constraints with edge case validation.",
